# Design System (StaySite)

Aligned with `promo.png` product design.

## Brand

- **Product name**: StaySite
- **Tagline**: "AI Websites for Hotels & Rentals"
- **Primary**: StaySite blue (`--color-brand` / `brand-600`) for CTAs, progress, links
- **Neutrals**: White backgrounds, clean gray text hierarchy, generous whitespace
- **Corners**: Rounded buttons and cards (`rounded-lg` / `rounded-xl`)
- **Photography**: Full-bleed hero images; room cards in 3-column grid on desktop

## Builder UI

- **Top nav**: Logo, Sites, Help, profile avatar
- **Left sidebar**: Step checklist with completion checkmarks; sticky "Generate My Website" CTA at bottom
- **Right pane**: Live site preview (desktop frame); mobile preview optional in Phase 1
- **Progress**: Describe → Generate → Customize → Publish (marketing); builder uses 7 questionnaire steps

## Generated site template

- **Header**: Property name, nav (Rooms, Gallery, Location, Contact), prominent "Book Now"
- **Hero**: Full-width image, headline, subheadline (location), primary CTA
- **Home sections**: Room highlights grid, amenity highlights, trust/essentials bar
- **Mobile-first**: Stack columns; touch-friendly CTAs

Use Tailwind theme tokens — no ad-hoc hex in components. Owner brand color from questionnaire applies as CSS variable `--site-accent`.
